---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | The P List"
  description="How The P List collects, uses and protects your information, including details on cookies, analytics and advertising."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <div class="wrap legal-page">
    <span class="eyebrow" data-reveal>Legal</span>
    <h1 data-reveal style="margin-top:14px;transition-delay:60ms">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated" data-reveal style="transition-delay:100ms">Last updated: 30 August 2026</p>

    <p data-reveal style="transition-delay:140ms">This Privacy Policy explains how The P List ("we", "us", "theplist.com.au") collects, uses and discloses information when you visit our website. By using this site, you agree to the collection and use of information in line with this policy.</p>

    <h2>Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We don't require you to create an account or hand over personal details to browse the site. The main way we collect information is automatically, through cookies and similar technologies used by the services below. If you contact us directly &mdash; for example by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@theplist.com.au">hello@theplist.com.au</a> &mdash; we'll have whatever information you choose to send us (your email address, name, and message content).</p>

    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>We use Google AdSense to display advertising on this site. As part of running these ads, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies, web beacons, device identifiers and similar technologies to collect and process data about your visits to this and other websites &mdash; including your IP address, approximate location, browser and device information, and the pages you view &mdash; in order to serve ads that are more relevant to you and to measure how those ads perform.</p>
    <p>Third-party vendors, including Google, may use these cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to this site and/or other sites.</p>
    <p>Depending on where you're browsing from, we (or Google, on our behalf) may ask for your consent before setting non-essential cookies or serving personalised ads, in line with applicable law. You can withdraw or change that consent at any time using the cookie settings on this site, where shown.</p>
    <p>You have choices about how this data is used:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Opt out of personalised advertising by Google via <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google's Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>Opt out of personalised ads from a number of third-party vendors via <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">www.aboutads.info</a> (US) or <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">youronlinechoices.eu</a> (EU).</li>
      <li>Adjust your browser settings to block or delete cookies, though this may affect how the site functions.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can find out more about how Google uses data when you use our site by visiting <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use this site &mdash; things like which pages are popular and how people found us. Google Analytics collects information anonymously and reports website trends without identifying individual visitors. You can opt out of Google Analytics by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Email newsletter</h2>
    <p>If you choose to sign up to hear from us, we use Mailchimp to manage and send emails. Your email address is stored with Mailchimp for that purpose and you can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email we send.</p>

    <h2>Third-party links and embeds</h2>
    <p>Some listings link out to real estate agent websites, and some pages embed YouTube videos. These third parties may collect information about your interaction with their content in line with their own privacy policies. We're not responsible for the content or privacy practices of external sites.</p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p>

    <h2>Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@theplist.com.au">hello@theplist.com.au</a>.</p>

    <a href="/" class="btn btn-solid" data-reveal style="margin-top:10px;">Back to the list</a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
